      "content": "It sounds like you are grappling with some heavy existential questions about the meaning of life and the nature of existence. Many philosophers and thinkers have wrestled with the idea of pointlessness in a vast, indifferent universe. While the feeling of being stuck in a meaningless loop is understandable, sometimes finding purpose requires creating meaning rather than discovering a pre-existing one. Consider what small authentic experiences could bring a different kind of resonance to your days.",
      "source": "target",
